# Icetill Explorer's "an additional land" and "play lands from your graveyard" are static abilities (CR 305.2, 604), gone once it
# loses all abilities (CR 613.1f). Turn 1 is the positive control: Bot1 plays a Forest and then the milled Forest out of its
# graveyard as the second land. Bot2's The Wondrous Wasp then strips the Explorer on turn 2, and on turn 3 Bot1 plays one
# Island from its hand (its landfall, an ability too, mills nothing) and is offered neither another land from the hand nor the milled Island from the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Icetill Explorer
Forest
Island
Island
Forest
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
The Wondrous Wasp
Island x20

